    "type": "WSI",
    "diagnosis": "Papillary thyroid carcinoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Tall cell subtype. The tumour is composed of complex papillary and elongated trabecular formations that have a tram-track appearance. They are lined by crowded cells that have a height-to-width ratio of &ge;&nbsp;3:1.",
    "source": "Chan Kwon Jung",
    "copyright": "",
