    "fileId": 28147,
    "type": "WSI",
    "diagnosis": "Papillary thyroid carcinoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Solid type. The tumour is only partially encapsulated. The neoplastic cells are arranged in a solid pattern with only small follicles noted. The nuclear features of papillary carcinoma are well developed. Note the fatty metaplasia, a curious but not significant finding.",
